      "title": "Error & Distribution Analysis: Logit_MAE",
      "doc": "Boss_Union_Almost_Full_Logit_MAE_Error_Analysis.md",
      "note": "Target Transformation (Logit):: The target variable was modeled in Logit (log-odds) space to enforce predictions between `[0, 1]` and trained using Mean Absolute Error (MAE). An inverse-logit (`expit`) transformation has been applied to all model predictions in this document to return them to the original probability space for direct comparison against the true target.",
